<mj-text>Hi {{ customer.first_name | default: "there" }},</mj-text>
<mj-text>It's been a while since you used Hydrilla. Your models are still in your account{% if customer.credits_remaining %}, along with {{ customer.credits_remaining | default: 0 }} credits{% endif %}.</mj-text>
<mj-text>If you have a project coming up, everything is ready for you.</mj-text>
<mj-text><a href="https://hydrilla.ai/app/studio">Open Studio</a></mj-text>
<mj-text>If Hydrilla didn't fit what you needed, a one-line reply telling me why would help us a lot.</mj-text>
<mj-text>Tejesh Varma,<br />Head of Growth<br />Team Hydrilla AI</mj-text>
